# BUG-130 (C-LEVEL-1.A, ros_ws/docs/levelling_frame.md, ingest site E9): the six Leg targets
# of the Levelled Active pose, served by trajectory_node. They are the IK of
# _corrected_neutral_pose() in the emitter's convention (motor_rev = ext_mm x GEOM_MM_TO_REV),
# never clipped. Refused (success=false, message says why) when no levelling correction is
# loaded, or when a Leg leaves the can-bridge ACTIVATE_TO band (0.10 rev of the constant
# Active pose): the message then names the Leg and the size.
---
bool success
string message
float64[] leg_targets_rev
